{"3376600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stormlander", "steam_appid": 3376600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate siege warfare! The storm-tossed battlefield awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash with swords, hurl spells, and break through enemy lines with your legions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stormlander is a fantasy competitive action game where strategy, shooting, and melee combat swirl together—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a whirlwind of all things war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges solely on strategy, your skill, and your unyielding fighting spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/076a57ac529ffc9e4423597edf1b5d56.webp?t=1784778852\" width=936 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ From 100-player to 12 vs. 12 battles, experience both chaotic melee and extreme tactical warfare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just about massive 100 players battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new 12 vs. 12 mode lets you deeply enjoy skill and teamwork, where each player's individual skill and movement tactics decide victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it's smaller-scale, a single player's judgment and fighting style can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/af5b9b7dbe224a62526fbba99360a91c.avif?t=1784778852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras_big/af5b9b7dbe224a62526fbba99360a91c.avif?t=1784778852 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/076a57ac529ffc9e4423597edf1b5d56.webp?t=1784778852\" width=936 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Reborn Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Skills: Drive in finishing blows from combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Magic Shot: Enjoy greater freedom and deeper gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge in! Slam down! Blow them away! Battle system completely revamped!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolved for an adrenaline-pumping feel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/076a57ac529ffc9e4423597edf1b5d56.webp?t=1784778852\" width=936 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ New Hero: “Female Mage”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's been waiting for this. The Female Mage finally joins the fray!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for additional costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/076a57ac529ffc9e4423597edf1b5d56.webp?t=1784778852\" width=936 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ The weapons go on a rampage, battlefields change every time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new wacky surprise weapons are coming your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weapons appearing on the battlefield change with each match,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unexpected twists will emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A “different battlefield” awaits you every time you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/bea2700f2412d4d646652628a8df75f6.avif?t=1784778852\" width=1024 height=570 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/076a57ac529ffc9e4423597edf1b5d56.webp?t=1784778852\" width=936 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Its simplicity is what makes it thrilling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you defend, strike, or outsmart your foes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize victory with swords, sorcery, strategy, and sheer momentum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/eed9779a29d95bbbb7e013711bba195d.avif?t=1784778852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras_big/eed9779a29d95bbbb7e013711bba195d.webp?t=1784778852 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376600/extras/076a57ac529ffc9e4423597edf1b5d56.webp?t=1784778852\" width=936 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stormlander – Dive into epic siege warfare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storm-tossed battlefield engulfs all!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate siege warfare! The storm-tossed battlefield awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash with swords, hurl spells, and break through enemy lines with your legions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stormlander is a fantasy competitive action game where strategy, shooting, and melee combat swirl together—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a whirlwind of all things war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges solely on strategy, your skill, and your unyielding fighting spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_